				(description "Stand Off\n\nDrill holes for mechanically mounting via screws, standoffs, etc.\n\nNote: Use the keepout ring to avoid running the screw head into surrounding components. Variant Overviews\n\n• STAND-OFF - Mechanical footprint for a #4 phillips button head screw.\n• STAND-OFF-TIGHT - Mechanical footprint for a #4 phillips button head screw,\n\nExample SparkFun Products\n\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/10453 Screw - Phillips Head (1/4\", 4-40, 10 pack) (PRT-10453)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/10452 Screw - Phillips Head (1/2\", 4-40, 10 pack) (PRT-10452)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/10451 Screw - Phillips Head (3/4\", 4-40, 10 pack) (PRT-10451)\n• https://www.sparkfun.com/products/10450 Screw - Phillips Head (1\", 4-40, 10 pack) (PRT-10450)")
