				(field
					(name "Description") "Antenna w/ Ground Connection\n\n2.4GHz antennae with signal and ground terminals.\n\n• TRACE_ANTENNA_2.4GHZ_15.2MM - Meander Trace antenna\n\n• 15.2 x 5.7mm footprint\n• Based on layout from http://www.ti.com/lit/an/swra117d/swra117d.pdf TI app note AN043.\n\n• TRACE_ANTENNA_2.4GHZ_25.7MM - Inverted F trace antenna\n\n• 25.7 x 7.5 mm footprint.\n• Based on layout from http://www.ti.com/lit/an/swru120b/swru120b.pdf TI design note DN0007.")
